ingjixie.com/cn/xwzx/hyzx/59.html\n   袋子封口不牢固:调整封口装置的温度和压力,确保封口牢固。 制袋机停机:传感器故障或误动作;控制系统故障。 制袋机出现电气故障:检查电路连接是否良好,检 ...\n5. 立式包装机容易出现的一般故障\n   http://www.alphapack.cn/wap/axw_view.php?id=23\n   1、 查看皮带是否有打滑现象。 · 2、 查看高温胶带是否完好。 · 3、 查看制袋器衣领处有无异物。 · 4、 查看光纤头与包装膜之间的距离和位置。 · 5、 看放膜电机工作是否正常。\n6. 自动装袋机故障排除：预防性维护指南\n   https://selectpacktech.com/zh/auto-bagging-machines-troubleshooting-guide/\n   快速参考：常见故障及解决方法 ; 袋子融化或烧穿, 温度过高或停留时间过长, 降低密封温度；检查加热棒是否有碎屑堆积。 ; 袋子无法吹开, 气嘴堵塞或气压过低 ...\n7. 自动薄膜封口机常见问题解决方法\n   https://www.ding-ye.com.cn/article/zdbmfkjcjw_1.html\n   封口不牢是封口机的常见故障之一，封口不牢有三层意思：①包装袋封口处无法封上;②在封刀压力作用下，袋口虽封上了，但稍用力挤压或撕剥，封口便又开裂;③ ...\n8. 制袋机较为常见的三种故障及排除方法\n   http://cnwzsf.com/html/news/hy/2021/0421/155.html\n   在日常的生产中也难免出现一些问题，以下是制袋机比较常见的三种问题，大家一起来了解和认识下，在遇到问题时也能找到处理的方法。\n9. 凹印软包装制袋机常见的问题与解决方法（一）\n   https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/344605769\n   答：1. 光电头上的灰尘较多； 2. 光电灵敏度不够； 3. 跟踪电不明显； 4. 封刀压力过大； 5. 胶棍上有脏东西； 6. 送料浮动辊气压过大； 7. 放料张力过大 ...\n10. 制袋机常见故障 - 爱采购寻源宝典\n   https://b2bwiki.baidu.com/article/743691437353533441\n   一、封口问题：温度与压力的博弈 · 加热板温度异常：热电偶失效或温控模块故障 · 压力不均：气缸气压不足或硅胶条老化 · 材料适配问题：PE膜和PP膜所需温度差 ..."},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"web_search","content":"（来源: serper）\n1. Troubleshooting the 11 Most Common Film Related ...\n   https://www.rovema-na.com/blog/troubleshooting-the-11-most-common-film-related-problems-with-a-vffs\n   Vertical seal or cross sealing jaws need cleaning; Film is misaligned to expose the sealant material inside the bag to the heated seal band.\n2. Packaging Machinery Problem Solving\n   https://www.polyprint.com/packaging-machinery-problem-solving/\n   Cause: Back-up bar bent or misaligned. Seal not made over full length. If misalignment of bar is excessive, either toward or away from the machine, tube ...\n3. Troubleshooting Tips for Common China Bag Making ...\n   https://www.chovyting.com/industry-news/troubleshooting-tips-for-common-china-bag-making-machine-issues\n   Why is my bag making machine not sealing correctly? Incorrect temperature settings, uneven pressure, worn sealing knives, or unstable film ...\n4. How to troubleshoot common problems in a bag making ...\n   https://www.highseaplas.com/blog/how-to-troubleshoot-common-problems-in-a-bag-making-machine-1159297.html\n   Sometimes, the length sensor can malfunction. Check the sensor for any signs of damage or misalignment. If the sensor is faulty, replace it. 4.\n5. Bag Machine Troubleshooting Guide - Toplusse\n   https://www.toplusse.com/blog/bag-machine-troubleshooting-guide-common-issues\n   Encountering weak seals, crooked bags, or registration loss? This guide covers common faults, solutions, and a quick diagnostic flow to ...\n6. 5 Common Problems with VFFS Machines and How to Fix Them\n   https://www.kinsunpack.com/news/5-common-problems-with-vffs-machines-and-how-to-fix-them.html\n   The most common VFFS machine problems include poor sealing, film misalignment, inconsistent filling, incorrect bag length, product trapped ...\n7. The common issues and solutions of bag making machine\n   https://www.dahepowderfiller.com/resources/the-common-issues-and-solutions-of-bag-making-machine.html\n   1. Tension of servo motor is not well adjusted. · 2. Traction rollers do not drag the material. · 3. Rubber Roller has diameter error.\n8. Troubleshooting Forming Problems on Vertical FFS Baggers\n   https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKTE_3LLj6Q\n   Share your videos with friends, family, and the world.\n9. Troubleshooting 10 Common VFFS Packaging Machine Issues\n   https://qualipakmachines.com/troubleshooting-10-common-vffs-packaging-machine-issues/\n   Adjusting Drop Time and Dosing Speed. To fix product in seal contamination, you have to synchronize the filling cycle with the bag-making cycle.\n10. How to Fix Inconsistent Bag Length on Your Bag Making ...\n   https://www.chinatplast.com/company-news/how-to-fix-inconsistent-bag-length-on-your-bag-making-machine\n   As the roll diameter decreases, tension can shift if the unwinder isn't compensating properly.Servo or encoder issues — Incorrect servo ..."},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"0inXAIGHPmuqPRDhxg47ZK0qS8CqP65N","function":{"index":0,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/344605769"}}},{"id":"xW8LlHDZ4r41CQ6UcTMHKJOFdq4AANoK","function":{"index":1,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://www.chovyting.com/industry-news/troubleshooting-tips-for-common-china-bag-making-machine-issues"}}},{"id":"ZIdnwuJySOYm7rMBMLcebNnbb7V41sll","function":{"index":2,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://www.toplusse.com/blog/bag-machine-troubleshooting-guide-common-issues"}}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"知乎，让每一次点击都充满意义 —— 欢迎来到知乎，发现问题背后的世界。"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"Troubleshooting Tips for Common China Bag Making Machine Issues | CHOVYTING We use cookies to improve your browsing experience. By continuing to usethis website, you agree to our use of cookies. Accept All  |  Decline All Skip to content \n +8613958813143 \n [email protected] \n Search \n Facebook-f \n Youtube \n Tiktok \n Home Products Plastic Bag Making Machine Side sealing bag making machine Bottom sealing bag making machine Rolling garbage bag Vest bag making machine Laminated Pouch Making Machine Series FFS Industry Heavy Duty Bag Making Machine Series Auxiliary equipment About R&D Videos Service Blog Solution Projects Franchise Contact \n INDUSTRY NEWS \n Home\n Blog\n Industry News \n May 25, 2026 \n Troubleshooting Tips for Common China Bag Making Machine Issues With the rapid growth of the global packaging industry, more manufacturers are choosing high-speed China bag making machines to improve production efficiency and reduce manufacturing costs. These machines are widely used for producing shopping bags, courier bags, garbage bags, zipper pouches, food packaging bags, and industrial heavy-duty packaging bags. However, during long-term high-speed production, factories often encounter problems such as poor sealing, inaccurate bag length, film deviation, servo motor alarms, unstable cutting, and excessive material waste. If these issues are not solved quickly, they can lead to production downtime, increased operating costs, and customer complaints. In this article, we will discuss the most common China bag making machine issues, their causes, troubleshooting methods, and preventive maintenance solutions. Whether you operate a side sealing bag making machine, bottom sealing bag making machine, wicket bag machine, pouch making machine, or FFS heavy-duty bag making machine, this guide can help improve production stability and machine lifespan. Why Troubleshooting Is Important in Modern Bag Making Machines Manufacturing Modern plastic bag production lines operate at extremely high speeds. Some advanced high speed bag making machines can now reach over 500 pcs/min, while multi-line systems can exceed 2000 pcs/min output capacity. Under these conditions, even a small machine problem may lead to serious production losses.   Common Production Risks ● Bag sealing defects \n● Printing position errors \n● Film feeding instability \n● Bag length inconsistency \n● Servo synchronization failures \n● Material waste increase \n● Production downtime Factories that perform effective troubleshooting and preventive maintenance can significantly improve machine stability, product quality, and operational efficiency. Common Sealing Problems in China Bag Making Machines Bag sealing quality directly affects the strength, appearance, and usability of plastic packaging bags. Poor sealing is one of the most common issues in plastic bag production. Why Is the Bag Not Sealing Properly? Several factors can cause weak or incomplete sealing: ● Incorrect sealing temperature \n● Uneven sealing pressure \n● Damaged heating elements \n● Low-quality plastic film \n● Excessive production speed \n● Worn sealing knife When sealing temperature is too low, the film layers cannot fully bond together. On the other hand, excessive temperature may burn the film and cause wrinkles or deformation. How to Troubleshoot Sealing Problems Step 1: Check Temperature Settings Verify whether the sealing temperature matches the film material. Film Material Recommended Temperature HDPE 140–180°C LDPE 120–160°C PP Film 160–220°C Laminated Film Depends on layer structure Step 2: Inspect Sealing Knife A worn or contaminated sealing knife often causes poor sealing consistency. Check for: ● Carbon buildup \n● Knife surface damage \n● Uneven pressure \n● Incorrect knife alignment Step 3: Adjust Machine Speed High-speed production may reduce sealing time. Lowering machine speed slightly can improve sealing quality. Bag Length Inaccuracy During Production Bag length inconsistency is especially common in high-speed side sealing bag making machines and bottom sealing machines. Common Symptoms ● Different bag lengths \n● Misaligned printing \n● Incorrect cutting positions \n● Unstable bag registration Main Causes 1. EPC Alignment Failure The EPC (Edge Position Control) system maintains film alignment during production. If the EPC sensor is dirty or improperly calibrated, film deviation may occur. 2. Servo Synchronization Problems Servo motors control film feeding and cutting accuracy. Incorrect servo parameters may result in unstable bag length. 3. Film Tension Instability Uneven tension stretches the plastic film, changing actual bag dimensions. Troubleshooting Solutions ● Clean EPC sensors daily \n● Recalibrate photoelectric tracking \n● Check servo motor settings \n● Maintain constant film tension \n● Inspect encoder feedback signals Advanced China bag making machines now use intelligent servo algorithms to improve bag length precision during ultra-high-speed production.   Film Feeding and EPC Tracking Problems Film tracking problems can seriously affect bag appearance and production stability. Common Film Feeding Issues ● Film drifting left or right \n● Wrinkled feeding \n● Printing offset \n● Feeding vibration \n● Unstable rewinding Causes of Film Deviation Cause Impact Dirty EPC sensor Inaccurate correction Loose rollers Feeding instability Uneven tension Film wrinkles Poor servo response Printing misalignment Solutions Clean the EPC System Dust or film debris may interfere with sensor detection. Check Roller Parallelism Misaligned rollers can cause continuous film drifting. Stabilize Tension Control Modern automatic bag making machines use servo tension systems to maintain stable film feeding. Servo Motor Alarm Troubleshooting Servo systems are critical components in fully automatic bag making machines. When servo alarms occur, the entire production line may stop immediately. Common Servo Alarm Causes ● Overload operation \n● Voltage fluctuation \n● Encoder communication failure \n● Incorrect PLC parameters \n● Excessive acceleration settings How to Solve Servo Alarms Inspect Electrical Wiring Loose cables or unstable connectors may interrupt communication signals. Reset Servo Parameters Improper acceleration and deceleration settings can overload the servo system. Reduce Production Speed If machine speed exceeds the servo system capacity, overload alarms may occur. Check Encoder Signals Damaged encoders reduce positioning accuracy. Cutting Problems in High-Speed Bag Making Machines Cutting precision is extremely important for high-quality plastic bag production. Common Cutting Problems ● Uneven cutting edges \n● Incorrect cutting position \n● Film tearing \n● Excessive burrs \n● Knife overheating Causes of Cutting Problems Worn Flying Knife Flying knife systems experience wear during long-term high-speed operation. Servo Timing Mismatch Incorrect synchronization between feeding and cutting systems causes inaccurate cuts. Machine Vibration Weak machine structures may reduce cutting stability at high speeds. Why Flying Knife Technology Is Important Modern flying knife bottom sealing bag making machines provide: ● Higher cutting speed \n● Better sealing appearance \n● Reduced waste \n● Improved production stability \n● Better performance during continuous operation Chovyting Machinery has continuously upgraded flying knife technology, achieving significant speed improvements in recent years. Preventive Maintenance Tips for Bag Making Machines Preventive maintenance helps reduce unexpected downtime and extend machine lifespan. Daily Maintenance Checklist ● Clean sealing bars \n● Remove film dust \n● Inspect sensors \n● Lubricate moving parts \n● Check air pressure \n● Monitor heating temperature Weekly Maintenance Maintenance Item Purpose Servo inspection Prevent alarm failures EPC calibration Improve tracking accuracy Roller cleaning Stabilize film feeding Knife inspection Maintain cutting quality Electrical cabinet cleaning Prevent overheating Monthly Maint\n…（共 14787 字，已读到 8000；接着读请用 offset=8000）"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":""},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"fIIUd1hqQVeNLyb9kY4bHnIjnV20RscU","function":{"index":0,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://www.chinatplast.com/company-news/how-to-fix-inconsistent-bag-length-on-your-bag-making-machine"}}},{"id":"ny9wsuS5V38MpVsYdzlLLK22Eshm7v0U","function":{"index":1,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"http://cc-zdj.com/newsdetail/zhidaijichangjianguzhang.html"}}},{"id":"dYuWsDOV25ToyzdSf4ALh5mWkS83Fnf2","function":{"index":2,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://www.toplusse.com/blog/bag-machine-troubleshooting-guide-common-issues","offset":1}}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"How to Fix Inconsistent Bag Length on Your Bag Making Machine - RUIAN TPLAST MACHINE CO.,LTD. \n +8613587581245 \n English \n English \n Français \n Español \n -->\n Home \n About us \n Company Profile \n Product Application \n Customer \n Products \n Bag Making Machine \n Film Blowing Machine \n Plastic Recycling Machine \n Printing Machine \n News \n Company News \n Expo News \n Certificate \n Video \n Contact us \n Home \n News \n Company News \n Company News \n Expo News \n How to Fix Inconsistent Bag Length on Your Bag Making Machine \n Publish Time: 2026-07-18 09:23 Author: Site Editor Visit: 227 \n You set the bag length on your machine , start production, and everything looks fine—until you measure the finished bags. Some are 5 mm longer than they should be. Others are 3 mm short. The variation accumulates, and before you know it, you've wasted film, time, and customer trust. \n Inconsistent bag length is one of the most common—and most frustrating—issues in bag making. At high speeds, even small deviations multiply quickly. A machine rated for 200 bags per minute that produces inconsistent lengths may deliver far less usable output than a slower but more stable unit. \n The good news? Most length inconsistency problems have identifiable root causes and fixable solutions. This guide walks through the most common culprits and what to do about each one. \n Why Bag Length Inconsistency Happens \n Bag length is determined by a coordinated system of film feeding, sealing, and cutting units. When any part of this system drifts out of alignment, the finished bag length changes. The deviation can come from mechanical components, electrical controls, or the film itself. \n The Most Common Root Causes: \n Tension instability — Fluctuating film tension stretches or relaxes the material, changing the actual feed length. As the roll diameter decreases, tension can shift if the unwinder isn't compensating properly.Servo or encoder issues — Incorrect servo parameters, loose encoder couplings, or faulty feedback devices can produce position errors that directly affect bag length.Photoelectric sensor problems — Dust on the sensor lens, incorrect sensitivity settings, or misalignment can cause the machine to misread registration marks.Mechanical wear — Worn timing belts, loose pulleys, or slipping feed rollers introduce mechanical play that translates directly into length variation.Incorrect parameter settings — The preset film feeding length may not match the actual film characteristics. \n Tension Control: The Foundation of Consistent Length \n Tension is arguably the most critical factor in bag length consistency. If the film is pulled too tight, it stretches—and the bag comes out longer than the set value. If it's too loose, the film slips—and the bag comes out short. \n What to check: \n Unwinder tension compensation — As the film roll diameter decreases, the unwinder must adjust to maintain constant tension. If your machine uses a dancer roller system, check that it's moving freely and providing proper compensation.Feed roller nip pressure — Insufficient pressure between the feed rollers allows the film to slip. Worn rubber rollers are a common culprit. Clean or replace rollers that show signs of wear.Tension setpoint calibration — Different film materials and thicknesses require different tension settings. What works for 150 GSM PE may not work for 350 GSM material. \n Servo Motor and Encoder Accuracy \n Modern bag making machines use servo motors for length control because they offer high precision and responsiveness. A high-quality servo-driven system can typically hold bag length accuracy within ±0.3 mm to ±0.5 mm. But even the best servo system is only as accurate as its setup and maintenance. \n Common servo-related issues: \n Encoder coupling looseness — If the encoder coupling is loose, the feedback signal won't match the actual motor position. Tighten the coupling and verify alignment.Incorrect servo parameters — Wrong gain settings or acceleration curves can cause overshoot or undershoot in film feeding. Review the parameter settings against the machine manual and adjust gradually.Mechanical binding — If the rubber roller connection to the servo motor has a blockage or binding issue, the feed will be inconsistent. \n Photoelectric Registration and Sensor Issues \n For printed bags, the photoelectric sensor (electric eye) tracks registration marks to determine where each bag should be cut. If the sensor isn't reading correctly, the bag length drifts. \n What to check: \n Sensor cleanliness — Dust and debris on the sensor lens are among the most common causes of tracking errors. Clean the lens regularly with a soft, lint-free cloth.Sensor alignment — Verify that the sensor is mounted rigidly and aimed correctly at the registration marks.Sensitivity settings — If the sensor is too sensitive, it may pick up false signals from film flutter or reflections. If it's not sensitive enough, it may miss marks entirely. Adjust the threshold according to the manufacturer's specifications.Registration mark quality — Poorly printed or inconsistent registration marks can confuse the sensor. Check the film for print quality issues. \n Mechanical Drive and Feed System \n Even with perfect electronics, mechanical wear can introduce length errors. The feed system relies on belts, chains, pulleys, and rollers working together with zero play. \n Key mechanical checks: \n Timing belts and chains — Check for wear, stretching, or looseness. A loose belt changes the effective feed length.Pulley and shaft connections — Loose set screws or keyway wear can introduce rotational play. Inspect and tighten all connections.Feed roller condition — Rubber rollers wear over time. Check for flat spots, glazing, or uneven surfaces that reduce grip.Bearing condition — Worn bearings in the feed roller assembly can cause erratic film movement. \n Parameter Settings: The Simple Fix \n Sometimes the problem isn't mechanical or electrical—it's simply that the settings don't match the actual conditions. \n What to verify: \n Set length vs. actual length — Measure the actual film feed with a ruler and compare it to the set value. If there's a consistent offset, adjust the parameter.Speed-related drift — Some machines show length variation at different speeds. If the problem appears only at high speed, try reducing speed gradually to identify the threshold.Film thickness compensation — Thicker films may require different feed settings than thinner ones. \n A Systematic Troubleshooting Approach \n When you encounter inconsistent bag length, resist the urge to change multiple settings at once. A systematic approach saves time and prevents new problems. \n Summary \n Inconsistent bag length isn't just a quality issue—it's a cost issue. Every bag that falls outside specification is wasted material, wasted time, and potentially a lost customer. \n Key takeaways: \n Tension control is foundational — Fluctuating tension is the single most common cause of length variation.Servo systems require proper setup — Even the best servo motor won't deliver accuracy if parameters are wrong or mechanical connections are loose.Clean sensors regularly — Dust on the photoelectric sensor is a frequent and easily preventable problem.Inspect mechanical components — Worn belts, pulleys, and rollers introduce play that translates directly into length error.Troubleshoot systematically — Change one variable at a time and document the results. \n Need Help Diagnosing Your Bag Length Issues? \n Every production line is different. Whether you're dealing with length inconsistency on a new machine or an older unit that's gradually drifting out of spec, our team can help identify the root cause and recommend the right solution. \n Contact our technical support team to discuss your machine configuration, film materials, and production targets. We'll help you get your bag length accuracy back on track. \n Last article： 2025 Bag Making Machine Market Size & Automation Trends | TPLAST \n Next i\n…（共 9103 字，已读到 8000；接着读请用 offset=8000）"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"制袋机常见故障-汕头市长诚包装机械有限公司 \n 首页 关于我们 产品中心 BXZD-高速背心机系列 FQ+R点断连卷系列 FQ-底封机系列 RQD-边封机系列 纸巾袋生产线系列 新闻中心 行业新闻 公司新闻 资源中心 常见问题 成功案例 视频中心 下载中心 联系我们 联系我们 \n 语言 \n 首页 关于我们 产品中心 BXZD-高速背心机系列 FQ+R点断连卷系列 FQ-底封机系列 RQD-边封机系列 纸巾袋生产线系列 新闻中心 行业新闻 公司新闻 资源中心 常见问题 成功案例 视频中心 下载中心 联系我们 联系我们 \n 首页 新闻中心 制袋机常见故障 \n 新闻中心 \n 行业新闻 公司新闻 \n 最新资讯 \n 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（下） 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（上） 制袋机常见的维护 制袋机常见故障 购买制袋机选哪家？ 长诚包装机械有限公司展会 \n 制袋机常见故障 \n 日期:2022-06-01 浏览量:5774 \n 1 \n 点进点退或正常工作,步进电机不能正常运转,有卡住的声音 \n 1.驱动电源坏,缺相 \n 2. 步进电机航空插头接 \n 触不良烧坏 \n 1.维修驱动电源 \n 2.更换航空插头或直接将电机连线，连接于输出线 \n 2 \n 点进点退正常但正常工作步进电机不能正常运转 \n 1.GK1、GK2坏 \n 2.磁钢缺少或错位 3.GK1、GK2线路不导通 \n 1.更换GK1、GK2 \n 2.补齐磁钢或调整错位磁钢 \n 3. 维护GK1、GK2线路 \n 3 \n 制白袋时送出长度不正确 \n (制彩袋时送出长度不正确也参考此) \n 1.电脑故障 \n 2.橡胶直径误差太大 \n 3.同步带打滑 \n 4.薄膜与橡胶辊磨擦打滑 \n 5.色标光电未调整好 \n 1重调整数据或维修 \n 2.将设定数增大或减小 \n 3.维修 \n 4.加大胶辊压力 \n 5.调整色标光电灵敏度及光电头与薄膜间的距离 \n 4 \n 制袋时常出现超速、停机 \n 1.长度设置偏短 \n 2.主机速度过快 \n 3.色标光电灵敏度未调好 \n 4.静电消除器干扰 \n 1.适当增加长度设定值 \n 2.适当减慢主机速度 \n 3.重新调整色标光电 灵敏度 \n 4.机器接\"地\"或静电消除器外壳接\"地\" \n 5 \n 主电机不能起动 \n 1.主机接触器损坏或接触器控制电路不通 \n 2.4123小继电器损坏 \n 3.主机起动按钮故障 \n 1.更换主接触器，检查并接通其控制电路 \n 2.更换小继电器 \n 3.检修 \n 6 \n 后放料电机不转 \n 1.电机损坏 \n 2.放料电眼头失灵 \n 3.放料板故障 \n 4..线头脱落 \n 1.查电机或更换 \n 2.检查电眼头BG4 \n 3.查双向可控硅BT41 \n 4.查线,接上线头 \n 7 \n 后放料电机直转不停 \n 1.放料电眼头失灵 \n 2.反射物颜色太深,反光-不够 \n 3.放料板故障 \n 1.查电眼头BG4 \n 2.换反射物或把电眼头移位,增 大反光度 \n 3.查BT41及吸收电容473 \n 8 \n 焊线不牢 \n 1.温度偏低 \n 2.压力不够 \n 1.重调封刀与底座温度 \n 2.加大封刀压力 \n 上一个: 带你了解 连卷袋制袋机的保养方法 \n 下一个: 制袋机常见的维护 \n 相关新闻 \n 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（下） 问：经常出现温度不稳定？ 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（上） 问：过中间胶辊时袋子皱？ 制袋机常见的维护 平口机的冷切刀切不断是什么原因？ 制袋机常见故障 1.点进点退或正常工作,步进电机不能正常运转,有卡住的声音 \n 产品中心 \n BXZD-高速背心机系列 FQ+R点断连卷系列 FQ-底封机系列 RQD-边封机系列 纸巾袋生产线系列 \n 订阅邮件 \n 我们在这里为您提供令人满意的服务。 \n 联系我们 \n 电话:+86-754-82124428 82124408 邮箱: sales@changchengmachinery.com 地址:汕头市潮汕路月浦龙兴工业区右侧第三间 \n 版权所有 © 汕头市长诚包装机械有限公司 粤ICP备2022066357号-1 \n XML \n 网站地图 \n 技术支持：橙树网络 \n 菜单 \n 产品中心 \n 联系我们 \n 顶部 \n +86-754-82124428 +86-754-82124408 sales@changchengmachinery.com 微信 顶部"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":""},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"TEyN72TDCNqZeiyVvnTqKsy2vKnglVbG","function":{"index":0,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"https://cn.zhoutaimachine.com/index.php?m=home&c=View&a=index&aid=20"}}},{"id":"PIOufXSTPeocJPJHu94xK0mzEh79p4p1","function":{"index":1,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"http://www.zjghjx.com/News_show.asp?id=412"}}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"制袋机技术难点及解决办法部分剖析_上海洲泰轻工机械制造有限公司 \n 中文简体 \n English \n Español \n Pусский \n Türkçe \n Bahasa Indonesia \n العربية \n Português \n 网站首页 \n 关于我们 \n 公司简介 \n 业务范围 \n 技术研发 \n 产品中心 \n 制袋机 \n 八边封/方底袋 \n 多功能自立袋 \n 中封/四边封袋 \n 辅助机器 \n 无溶剂复合机 \n 封管机 \n 行业应用 \n 液体包装 \n 综合液体包装 \n 盒中袋 \n 直嘴/斜嘴机 \n 宠物食品包装 \n 平底袋 \n 四边封袋（带拉链/把手/一片膜） \n 自立袋（湿粮） \n 工业包装 \n 精细化工包装 \n 真空袋 \n 医疗包装 \n 数码包装 \n 产品服务 \n 区域服务 \n 服务支持 \n 演示中心 \n 新闻中心 \n 公司新闻 \n 联系我们 \n Lanuage\n 中文简体 \n English \n 公司新闻 \n 首页 > 新闻中心 > 公司新闻 \n 新闻中心 \n > 公司新闻 \n 推荐产品 \n AMD450FSL-S \n 改良型方底袋制袋机 \n AMD650FSL-S13 \n 改良型方底拉链袋制袋机 \n AMD100-SI-ZX \n 制袋机技术难点及解决办法部分剖析 \n Views : \n Update time : 2024-10-10 \n 当我们使用制袋机时可能会遇到一些问题，怎么解决这些问题呢，今天向大家介绍一些普遍问题以及解决方法。 一、白袋长度有长短 可能原因: 1、伺服牵引张力不好; 2、拖料拉不动 ; 3、橡胶棍存在直径误差 解决办法: 1、调整伺服牵引曲线; 2、检查胶辊是否打滑，擦拭干净，或者减小放料气压张力; 3、更换胶辊 二、自立白立袋冲孔跑动误差太大，超过2mm 可能原因：1、伺服牵引浮动滚筒摆动幅度过大，跳动厉害; 2、薄膜拉伸; 3、胶辊打滑 解决办法：1、减少伺服张力补偿系数值，或者把浮动滚筒上抬减少其摆动范围; 2、降低薄膜热封温度，同时检查伺服牵引和烫压是否同步，若不同步调整主伺服抬刀角度，尽量保证其与高位信号角度为90度正负接近; 3、胶辊硬度太高超过75度，降低胶辊硬度更换新的胶辊；检查胶辊和薄膜之间是否有粉尘，擦拭干净 三、制袋时常停机 可能原因:1、主机速度过快，电压不稳； 2、主机霍尔信号角度不对，或者接触不良； 3、伺服驱动器报警 解决办法:1、主伺服驱动器设置正确的脉冲，检查伺服变压器电压； 2、调整抬刀和高位霍尔开关至正确位置90度，调整霍尔开关对正信号检测杆； 3、查看伺服驱动器对应报警代码逐个排除 四、主机不能启动 可能原因:1、伺服系统故障； 2、电脑信号中断； 3、主机接触器坏或接触器控制电路不通； 4、PLC出错报警 解决办法:1、检查伺服系统与电机工作是否正常； 2、接好信号线； 3、更换接触器； 4、检查接通其控制电路，消除PLC故障出错报警 五、热封刀封口不牢 可能原因:1、封刀不平整； 2、封刀加热控制断路； 3、控制电路或热电偶损坏； 4、烫刀压力不够 ； 解决办法:1、封刀上磨床磨平整； 2、更换电热板，检查其连接线； 3、检查修理或更换热电偶，更换温控模块； 4、调整封刀弹簧压力 七、过中间胶辊时袋子皱 可能原因：1、背封冷却效果不好； 2、中间胶辊压力不均匀； 3、浮动滚筒气压过大； 4、中间胶辊上灰尘过多； 5、热封温度过高 解决办法：1、增加冷水机制冷效果，降低冷水机温度；2、看看胶辊两边气压根据薄膜特性调整左右大小压力； 3、降低浮动滚筒压力； 4、擦拭胶辊； 5、降低烫刀热封温度 七、制袋机制袋长度定长系统误差过大 制袋长度分为空白袋定长和印刷定长，这两类定长系统都是由热封、切刀联动系统和走膜系统组成的，通过电眼联系在一起协调工作。如果联动或协调产生误差，就会引起与制袋长度相关的尺寸偏差。 重点讲解电眼跟踪不准。跟踪不准的原因有以下几点: 1、电眼问题:光电眼调整方法及工作状态选择不当。 首先要确认电眼是否调好，电眼反射及透射选择是否正确，其次要确认前沿控制还是后沿控制，即所谓极性，还要确认跟踪方式，如:扫描式(即先走完定长，然后扫描色标)、定长查位式(即走完定长后查一下是否有色标，是过头了还是没有到位)； 2、光标印制或间距问题； 3、光标设计不合理、可用的扫描区过于狭窄、光标与周围区域对比不明显； 4、光标间距有变化 \n Previous : 无溶剂复合在烟包领域的应用 \n Next : 可持续性包装的必然性 \n 推荐展会 \n Read More >> \n 如果您对我们的产品有建议或需求，请给我们留下宝贵的建议 ! \n 在线留言 \n 上海洲泰轻工机械制造有限公司 \n 地址：上海市青浦区华新镇新协路1253号 \n 电话：0086-021-69792345 \n 邮箱： info@zhoutaimachine.com \n 浙江洲泰机械有限公司 \n 地址：浙江省湖州市南浔经济开发区向阳西路2088号 \n 电话：0572-3057980 \n 产品中心 \n 制袋机 \n 无溶剂复合机 \n 封管机 \n 行业应用 \n 液体包装 \n 宠物食品包装 \n 工业包装 \n 医疗包装 \n 数码包装 \n Follow \n 微信二维码 \n 抖音二维码 \n Copyright © 2024-2028上海洲泰轻工机械制造有限公司 All rights reserved \n 网站首页 \n 关于我们 \n 产品中心 \n 行业应用 \n 产品服务 \n 新闻中心 \n 联系我们 \n Send Email \n Skype Chat \n Send Inquiry \n LiveChat 关闭 \n Leave Your Message \n Hit enter to search or ESC to close"},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"制袋机五种常见故障的处理办法 - 新闻中心 - 瑞安国华机械有限公司 \n CN \n EN --> \n JP --> \n EN --> \n 首页 \n 关于我们 \n 荣誉资质 \n 新闻中心 \n 产品展示 \n 吹膜机 \n 制袋机 \n 造粒机 \n 印刷机 \n 分切机 \n 气泡膜机|气垫膜机 \n 缠绕膜机|保鲜膜机 \n 辅助设备 \n 视频中心 \n 联系我们 \n 新闻中心 \n 制袋机五种常见故障的处理办法 \n 1、开机时步进电机有异声，不能送膜。 \n 处理办法： \n （1）检查主电机转向是否正确，调整到箭头指示的正确方向。 \n （2）步进电机驱动器是否显示故障，关断主电源重新通电即可恢复正常。 \n 2、工作过程中送膜尺寸长短不一，送料尺寸比预调尺寸短5mm以上，工作过程间歇出现一次不送膜。 \n 处理办法： \n （1）光电眼灵敏度调节不好或极性选择不对。 \n （2）光电开关对地漏电或端间短路，应更换。 \n （3）放料速度低于送料速度，需要放松各压膜压条，检查放料部分性能，排除故障。 \n 3、步进电机力矩明显下降，制袋尺寸不准确。 \n 处理办法：步进驱动器有故障，或胶辊与步进电机联接部分有阻卡现象。及时对步进驱动器进行检查和维修，连通胶辊和步进电机。 \n 4、制袋时光电跟踪不准确。 \n 处理办法： \n （1）光电眼调整方法及工作状态选择不正确，按说明书要求正确调整。 \n （2）预调的送膜长度（调整空白袋时）与实际制袋尺寸误差太大，应重新设置制线长度或调节压力、调整装置。 \n （3）过膜阻力过大或前道工序制品质量不良，应检查并更换材料。 \n 5、放料速度低或工作不正常。 \n 处理办法： \n （1）眼位开关接触不良或凸轮角度不好，应调整或更换。 \n （2）放料调速线路板可控硅或整流管击穿，应维修或更换。 \n 机械设备与其加工对象，在这里我们特指塑料薄膜，都有一个相互适应的特性，就是说，一台机械设备只能加工一定性质范围内的塑料薄膜，我们在了解塑料薄膜的性质的基础上，从制袋三要素出发，即：压力、温度、烫压时间，在制袋时（在保证烫压强度的前提下，相对而言）烫压力要大，烫压温度要低，烫压时间要长，经这样处理后的复合袋烫压封口就美观、漂亮、挺拔。 \n 返回列表 \n 关于国华 \n 荣誉资质 \n 新闻中心 \n 产品展示 \n 视频中心 \n 联系我们 \n 产品展示 \n 吹膜机 \n 制袋机 \n 造粒机 \n 印刷机 \n 分切机 \n 气泡膜机|气垫膜机 \n 缠绕膜机|保鲜膜机 \n 辅助设备 \n 扫一扫，关注我们 \n 联系我们 \n Tel：13967756569 全国统一服务热线 \n 地址： 浙江省瑞安市锦湖街道谢岙工业区 \n  \n  \n  \n  \n --> \n 备案号:浙ICP备16019353号 \n 网站建设 ： 联创网络 -->"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"tNnjJBGSoGhfg2QeaothE3gjJpC5lKf8","function":{"index":0,"name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"凹印软包装制袋机 常见问题 解决方法 色标 电眼 跟踪 封口"}}},{"id":"UObeNfTirJWu43E3935cowa5lcfW43Yx","function":{"index":1,"name":"fetch_url","arguments":{"url":"http://cc-zdj.com/newsdetail/zhidaijichangjianguzhang.html","offset":1}}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"web_search","content":"（来源: serper）\n1. 自动包装生产过程中常见六大问题\n   https://www.cnzhixiang.com/mobile/yinshua/pingce/1/835.html\n   一般的自动包装机的电眼系统是简单的识别系统，不能像制袋机那样具有智能定长的功能，因而在电眼光标纵向范围内，卷膜不允许有任何干扰的文字和图案，否则会引起识别错误。\n2. 凹印软包装制袋机常见的问题与解决方法（一）\n   https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/344605769\n   答：1. 后光电跟踪不灵敏； 2. 原材料张力不好； 3. 放料不均匀； 4. 上膜的多少不均； 5. 后白辊没按装好不紧，左右摆动； 6. 膜穿错辊；（黑轴，死轴） ...\n3. 自动薄膜封口机常见问题解决方法\n   https://www.ding-ye.com.cn/article/zdbmfkjcjw_1.html\n   在软包装制袋方面，该机也得到了广泛应用，当塑料薄膜制袋中出现边封、中封、底封牢度不良时，可利用该机进行再封口，从而达到热封质量要求。 该机 ...\n4. 塑料制袋必看！制袋机常见故障及解决方法来了！ - 天下软包装\n   http://www.txrbz.com/m/bbs/1047.html\n   1、调整封口温度,确保温度适当,一般来说,温度过高或过低都会导致封口效果不佳。 2、清洁封口条,确保没有残留物干扰封口过程。 3、调整封口压力\n5. 软包装工厂凹版印刷| KDW\n   https://kdwpack.com/zh-CN/gravure-printing/\n   针对凹印堵塞问题，可采用以下排除方法：. 增加墨水中的溶剂量; 降低油墨干燥速度; 使用表面强度高的纸张. 这些排除方法旨在防止或缓解凹印中的堵塞问题。\n6. 制袋机常见故障及处理办法 - 油墨刮刀\n   http://www.youmoguadao.com/guamodao_youmoguadao_8149.html\n   （1）光电眼灵敏度调节不好或极性选择不对。 （2）光电开关座对地漏电或端间短路，应更换。 （3）放料速度低于送料速度，需要放松各压膜压条，检查放料部分性能，排除故障 ...\n7. 制袋机温度与色标之谜\n   https://b2bwiki.baidu.com/article/d2t9a59ftjsqd47ikafg\n   本文揭秘制袋机工作时的理想温度区间，并解析色标跟踪失准的常见原因，从热封效果到光电感应，助你快速定位生产问题。\n8. 制袋机的常见故障有哪些\n   https://www.judingjixie.com/cn/xwzx/hyzx/59.html\n   4.袋子封口不牢固：调整封口装置的温度和压力，确保封口牢固。 5.送料不顺畅：送料辊或送料系统故障；材料卷筒不正或张力不均匀；材料质量问题，如厚度不 ...\n9. 立式包装机常见问题处理方法\n   https://www.samfull.cn/?cjwt/63.html\n   立式包装机常见问题处理方法 · 1、看同步带是否有打漏现象。 · 2、看衣领处是否有异物。 · 3、看各导膜轮有无卡位。 · 4、看放膜电机是否工作。 · 5、看高温 ...\n10. 全自动包装机色标光电眼定位问题及解决方案处理\n   https://www.sohu.com/a/419836288_120351435\n   1）全自动包装机色标光电眼不能定位容易抖动的原因及解决方法： · 2）全自动包装机色标光电眼跟踪不到位的解决办法 · 3）袋子额度定长不稳定 · 4）切袋位置 ..."},{"role":"tool","tool_name":"fetch_url","content":"袋机常见故障-汕头市长诚包装机械有限公司 \n 首页 关于我们 产品中心 BXZD-高速背心机系列 FQ+R点断连卷系列 FQ-底封机系列 RQD-边封机系列 纸巾袋生产线系列 新闻中心 行业新闻 公司新闻 资源中心 常见问题 成功案例 视频中心 下载中心 联系我们 联系我们 \n 语言 \n 首页 关于我们 产品中心 BXZD-高速背心机系列 FQ+R点断连卷系列 FQ-底封机系列 RQD-边封机系列 纸巾袋生产线系列 新闻中心 行业新闻 公司新闻 资源中心 常见问题 成功案例 视频中心 下载中心 联系我们 联系我们 \n 首页 新闻中心 制袋机常见故障 \n 新闻中心 \n 行业新闻 公司新闻 \n 最新资讯 \n 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（下） 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（上） 制袋机常见的维护 制袋机常见故障 购买制袋机选哪家？ 长诚包装机械有限公司展会 \n 制袋机常见故障 \n 日期:2022-06-01 浏览量:5775 \n 1 \n 点进点退或正常工作,步进电机不能正常运转,有卡住的声音 \n 1.驱动电源坏,缺相 \n 2. 步进电机航空插头接 \n 触不良烧坏 \n 1.维修驱动电源 \n 2.更换航空插头或直接将电机连线，连接于输出线 \n 2 \n 点进点退正常但正常工作步进电机不能正常运转 \n 1.GK1、GK2坏 \n 2.磁钢缺少或错位 3.GK1、GK2线路不导通 \n 1.更换GK1、GK2 \n 2.补齐磁钢或调整错位磁钢 \n 3. 维护GK1、GK2线路 \n 3 \n 制白袋时送出长度不正确 \n (制彩袋时送出长度不正确也参考此) \n 1.电脑故障 \n 2.橡胶直径误差太大 \n 3.同步带打滑 \n 4.薄膜与橡胶辊磨擦打滑 \n 5.色标光电未调整好 \n 1重调整数据或维修 \n 2.将设定数增大或减小 \n 3.维修 \n 4.加大胶辊压力 \n 5.调整色标光电灵敏度及光电头与薄膜间的距离 \n 4 \n 制袋时常出现超速、停机 \n 1.长度设置偏短 \n 2.主机速度过快 \n 3.色标光电灵敏度未调好 \n 4.静电消除器干扰 \n 1.适当增加长度设定值 \n 2.适当减慢主机速度 \n 3.重新调整色标光电 灵敏度 \n 4.机器接\"地\"或静电消除器外壳接\"地\" \n 5 \n 主电机不能起动 \n 1.主机接触器损坏或接触器控制电路不通 \n 2.4123小继电器损坏 \n 3.主机起动按钮故障 \n 1.更换主接触器，检查并接通其控制电路 \n 2.更换小继电器 \n 3.检修 \n 6 \n 后放料电机不转 \n 1.电机损坏 \n 2.放料电眼头失灵 \n 3.放料板故障 \n 4..线头脱落 \n 1.查电机或更换 \n 2.检查电眼头BG4 \n 3.查双向可控硅BT41 \n 4.查线,接上线头 \n 7 \n 后放料电机直转不停 \n 1.放料电眼头失灵 \n 2.反射物颜色太深,反光-不够 \n 3.放料板故障 \n 1.查电眼头BG4 \n 2.换反射物或把电眼头移位,增 大反光度 \n 3.查BT41及吸收电容473 \n 8 \n 焊线不牢 \n 1.温度偏低 \n 2.压力不够 \n 1.重调封刀与底座温度 \n 2.加大封刀压力 \n 上一个: 带你了解 连卷袋制袋机的保养方法 \n 下一个: 制袋机常见的维护 \n 相关新闻 \n 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（下） 问：经常出现温度不稳定？ 制袋机常见问题与解决办法（上） 问：过中间胶辊时袋子皱？ 制袋机常见的维护 平口机的冷切刀切不断是什么原因？ 制袋机常见故障 1.点进点退或正常工作,步进电机不能正常运转,有卡住的声音 \n 产品中心 \n BXZD-高速背心机系列 FQ+R点断连卷系列 FQ-底封机系列 RQD-边封机系列 纸巾袋生产线系列 \n 订阅邮件 \n 我们在这里为您提供令人满意的服务。 \n 联系我们 \n 电话:+86-754-82124428 82124408 邮箱: sales@changchengmachinery.com 地址:汕头市潮汕路月浦龙兴工业区右侧第三间 \n 版权所有 © 汕头市长诚包装机械有限公司 粤ICP备2022066357号-1 \n XML \n 网站地图 \n 技术支持：橙树网络 \n 菜单 \n 产品中心 \n 联系我们 \n 顶部 \n +86-754-82124428 +86-754-82124408 sales@changchengmachinery.com 微信 顶部"},{"role":"assistant","content":"","tool_calls":[{"id":"QC3r